  "per_sentence_premium_note": "The per-sentence premium DISTRIBUTION (median/p10..p90 in premium_by_language.csv) is measured on envelope-stripped content tokens (raw_counts.n_tokens_content): the vendor count-tokens APIs count a wrapped request, so each API counter's fixed frame (run_manifest.envelope_tokens_by_counter) is subtracted to compare like-for-like with the bare-text offline counters. The AGGREGATE premium is the raw paper-style concatenated count and is left envelope-INCLUSIVE; the frame is <0.05% of any corpus total, so the two bases are near-identical rather than identical.",
